{
  "set": "real-engine-engine-stall-v1",
  "description": "Measure and arm (c33, c34 fix; U13: a silent engine must not cost 180 s). A stall cannot be forced on a real engine, so this script does two things. first-event-times: six one-word turns with the watchdog OFF: every turn record carries firstEventMs (the first event of the turn, which is only the preamble: turn started and the user message, a few ms), firstProgressMs (the first event BEYOND the preamble: an assistant or reasoning item, a delta, a tool call; what the watchdog waits for) and latencyMs; N is chosen from the p99 of firstProgressMs (run it several times and at the effort EG-Desk uses). watchdog-armed: the same kind of turns with EGDESK_ENGINE_STALL_FIRST_EVENT_MS=30000: no turn may stall (engineStall stalled false, firstProgressMs under the limit). c34: check-29st had a REAL stall in this script (preamble within 2 ms, then silence for 180 s): the watchdog now waits for progress, not for any event, so it fires there and retries once. No Decision model needed.",
  "conversations": [
    {
      "id": "first-event-times",
      "turns": [
        {
          "say": "한 단어로만 답해: 하나",
          "expect": {
            "posted": true,
            "noNativeTools": true,
            "turnStatus": "completed"
          }
        },
        {
          "say": "한 단어로만 답해: 둘",
          "expect": {
            "posted": true,
            "noNativeTools": true,
            "turnStatus": "completed"
          }
        },
        {
          "say": "한 단어로만 답해: 셋",
          "expect": {
            "posted": true,
            "noNativeTools": true,
            "turnStatus": "completed"
          }
        },
        {
          "say": "한 단어로만 답해: 넷",
          "expect": {
            "posted": true,
            "noNativeTools": true,
            "turnStatus": "completed"
          }
        },
        {
          "say": "한 단어로만 답해: 다섯",
          "expect": {
            "posted": true,
            "noNativeTools": true,
            "turnStatus": "completed"
          }
        },
        {
          "say": "한 단어로만 답해: 여섯",
          "expect": {
            "posted": true,
            "noNativeTools": true,
            "turnStatus": "completed"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "watchdog-armed",
      "flags": {
        "EGDESK_ENGINE_STALL_FIRST_EVENT_MS": "30000"
      },
      "turns": [
        {
          "say": "한 단어로만 답해: 하나",
          "expect": {
            "posted": true,
            "noNativeTools": true,
            "turnStatus": "completed",
            "engineStall": {
              "stalled": false,
              "maxFirstProgressMs": 30000
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "say": "한 단어로만 답해: 둘",
          "expect": {
            "posted": true,
            "noNativeTools": true,
            "turnStatus": "completed",
            "engineStall": {
              "stalled": false,
              "maxFirstProgressMs": 30000
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "say": "한 단어로만 답해: 셋",
          "expect": {
            "posted": true,
            "noNativeTools": true,
            "turnStatus": "completed",
            "engineStall": {
              "stalled": false,
              "maxFirstProgressMs": 30000
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
